\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Another year is dawning:
\par Dear Master, let it be,
\par In working or in waiting,
\par Another year for Thee:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Another year of mercies,
\par Of faithfulness and grace;
\par Another year of gladness
\par In the shining of Thy face:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Another year of progress,
\par Another year of praise,
\par Another year of proving
\par Thy presence all the days:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Another year of service,
\par Of witness for Thy love;
\par Another year of training
\par For holier work above.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Another year is dawning:
\par Dear Master, let it be,
\par On earth, or else in heaven,
\par Another year of Thee,
\par                     Amen. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

